# Accepted vulnerability exceptions for the ERIS release gate (deploy/ci/release-gate.sh).
# The gate fails on fixable HIGH/CRITICAL vulnerabilities and on embedded secrets.
# Add an exception only with security approval, one ID per line, and a comment
# giving the reason, the approver and an expiry date, for example:
#
#   # Not reachable: ERIS never parses untrusted XML with this library.
#   # Approved: <name>, Caltrans security, 2026-11-02. Expires 2027-02-01.
#   CVE-0000-00000
#
# Review this file at every release; remove expired entries.
